  "body": "The camcraft-mcp skill (`.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`) has no row for `set_workholding_max_rpm {max_rpm: number|null, setup?}` (PR #1058, #1031: a setup's chuck/collet maximum rpm; `setup` defaults to the active one, `null` clears, one undoable step), nor for `get_job`'s new per-setup `workholding_max_rpm` field.\n\nProcess file: its own small PR with a `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` bump, opened only after PR #1058 merges so the table never names a tool main doesn't have; announce on #681.\n\nDone means: the tool and the get_job field appear in the skill's table with parameters and the undo note; PROCESS_VERSION bumped; #681 announced on merge.\n",
